  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/dependency-neoforge-d1bdff?labelColor=2D2D2D&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"286\" height=\"45\"> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/ST2wpVkXXF\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1443292723770822822?color=d1bdff&labelColor=2D2D2A&label=JOIN DISCORD&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"313\" height=\"40\"></a>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/short_1346380.svg?badge_style=for_the_badge\" width=\"112\" height=\"40\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DwrS0Rm.png\" alt=\"Gemforged Title\" width=\"1905\" height=\"331\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KnTNF1K.png\" alt=\"Gemforged adds several gemstones &amp; magical items.  Onyx &amp; Shadowstep Dagger - Shadowstep Dagger allows you to make 6 quick attacks, each one teleporting you keeping the aim on the enemy. - Onyx can be found in Woodland Mansion chests with a 25% chance.  Garnet &amp; Battle Charm - Using Battle Charm creates a red area &amp; providing players a new effect called Garnet Rage. This rage effect increases attack speed, attack damage &amp; slightly speed. - Garnet can be found in Pillager Outpost chests with a 20% chance.  Citrine &amp; Sandburst Staff - Using Sandburst Staff pushes every entity in a circle area, dealing them magic damage. - Citrine can be found in Desert Temple chests with a 10% chance.  Malachite &amp; Venomfang Blade - Venomfang Blade creates a poisonous area &amp; poisons everyone in that circle are on every third hit, same goes for wither effect on tenth hits. - Malachite can be found in Jungle Temple chests with a 20% chance.  Carnelian &amp; Phoenix Relic - Using Phoenix Relic saves your HP &amp; location and gives you a 30 second chance to revive on that location again. Try to die after using the relic! - Carnelian can be found in Nether Fortress chests with a 10% chance.  Zircon &amp; Thunder Prism - Using Thunder Prism summons several lightning bolts on enemies. - Zircon can be found in Ancient City chests with a 10% chance.  Shimmer - Shimmer is a new potion, increases attack damage, scale and jump strength. It can be brewed by using Shimmer Powder, which can be crafted by combining Pitcher Plant + Blaze Powder + Amethyst Shard.\" width=\"1400\" height=\"9126\"></p>",
